{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "static-page.schema.json",
  "title": "MaxBLD static page (archetype STATIC, web)",
  "$comment": "MF-46 stage C (plan ~/Buildo-scratch/mcfrontend/MF-46/plan.md v3 section 3.2 and section 12 fold 18; D-2 (a) operator \"1 y 2 y ...\" 2026-11-11). THE one home of the static page contract: the page table scripts/surfaces/_schema/static-page.json holds one page per STATIC surface per state, in screen order. CLOSED section kinds and part roles, mirroring report-page.schema.json (FE-34): MF-46 uses `prose` (a title, headings, paragraphs, list items and, on an error page, the one retry action) and `footer` (the links Terms, Privacy, Help & Support and the short legal line). The MaxBLD landing row (MF-76) adds hero, figures, items and plans by its own ruling. Every shown text is a content key of the surface's own content file (FE-18), never a value typed here and never a number (FE-05; a number fails this schema and throws in the binding). A link is a same-origin path (the host table decides where it leads). Read by src/components/surfaces/web/StaticBinding.tsx (the kinds and roles) and src/tests/surfaces/static-page.logic.test.ts (AJV over the table).",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "pages"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "$comment": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "pages": {
      "type": "object",
      "propertyNames": {
        "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_]+$"
      },
      "additionalProperties": {
        "type": "object",
        "propertyNames": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_]+$"
        },
        "minProperties": 1,
        "additionalProperties": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/page"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "page": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "sections"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "sections": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/section"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "section": {
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/prose"
        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/footer"
        }
      ]
    },
    "prose": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "kind",
        "id",
        "parts"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "const": "prose"
        },
        "id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/id"
        },
        "parts": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "$ref": "#/$defs/part",
            "properties": {
              "role": {
                "enum": [
                  "title",
                  "heading",
                  "paragraph",
                  "item",
                  "retry"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "footer": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "kind",
        "id",
        "parts"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "const": "footer"
        },
        "id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/id"
        },
        "parts": {
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "$ref": "#/$defs/part",
            "properties": {
              "role": {
                "enum": [
                  "link",
                  "legal"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "id": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_]+$"
    },
    "part": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "role",
        "content"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "role": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "content": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_]+(\\.[a-z0-9_]+)+$"
        },
        "href": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^/(?![/\\\\])[a-z0-9/_-]*$"
        }
      },
      "if": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "role": {
            "const": "link"
          }
        }
      },
      "then": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "href": true
        },
        "required": [
          "href"
        ]
      },
      "else": {
        "type": "object",
        "not": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "href": true
          },
          "required": [
            "href"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
